@ref O 60 r 13(3) (src:7038-7053)
GIVEN copies IS A `o 60 r 13(3) certified copies and certificate`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 60 r 13(3) the certified copies and certificate are what the Rule requires` MEANS
    IF count (`o 60 r 13(3) the matters the copies and certificate have not yet satisfied` copies) EQUALS 0
